# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored.
# Put the Mercado Pago *sandbox* access token here (it starts with TEST-).
# Never commit a real value. Never pass the token as a command argument.
#
# On a deployed Worker, Nico pastes the same token with:
#   npx wrangler secret put MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN
# That command deploys a new version. Do not run it until APROBAR DEPLOY.

MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Later phases only (reserve, newsletter, constellation). checkout-link does not read these.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
